{"title":"Partition With Exclusive Values","difficulty":"Medium","statement":"You are given an array `a` of `n` positive integers. Split **all** of its elements into two sets `A` and `B` (every element goes to exactly one of them, and either set may be empty) so that the absolute difference between the sum of `A` and the sum of `B` is as small as possible.\n\nThere is one extra rule about frequencies: **equal values must not appear in both sets**. If a value occurs several times in the array, all of its occurrences must be placed in the same set.\n\nReturn the minimum possible value of `|sum(A) - sum(B)|`.\n\nThis is the classic \"partition a set into two subsets with minimum difference of sums\" problem with the added frequency constraint.","inputFormat":"The first line contains an integer `n`.\nThe second line contains `n` integers `a[0] ... a[n-1]`.","outputFormat":"Print one integer: the minimum possible absolute difference of the two set sums.","constraints":["1 ≤ n ≤ 1000","1 ≤ a[i] ≤ 100"],"examples":[{"input":"5\n3 3 4 1 1","output":"0","explanation":"Keep both 3s together (sum 6) in set A, and put 4 and both 1s together in set B (sum 6). The difference is 0."},{"input":"4\n1 2 3 3","output":"3","explanation":"Without the extra rule we could split 1 + 3 and 2 + 3. Here both 3s must go together (sum 6), so the best split is {3, 3} against {1, 2}: |6 - 3| = 3."},{"input":"3\n7 7 7","output":"21","explanation":"All three 7s must be in the same set, so the other set is empty and the difference is 21."}],"tests":[{"input":"1\n5","output":"5"},{"input":"2\n1 1","output":"2"},{"input":"2\n1 2","output":"1"},{"input":"4\n10 20 30 40","output":"0"},{"input":"10\n100 100 100 100 100 100 100 100 100 100","output":"1000"},{"input":"6\n1 1 1 2 2 3","output":"2"},{"input":"4\n41 96 8 28","output":"19"},{"input":"4\n32 32 32 32","output":"128"},{"input":"6\n5 5 5 5 5 5","output":"30"},{"input":"6\n100 57 88 100 100 88","output":"67"},{"input":"8\n60 28 73 60 22 60 78 22","output":"13"},{"input":"8\n71 71 71 71 71 71 71 71","output":"568"},{"input":"12\n46 46 62 62 57 46 62 57 57 46 59 46","output":"68"},{"input":"12\n15 15 15 15 15 15 15 15 15 15 15 15","output":"180"},{"input":"20\n35 57 57 62 12 62 57 81 12 57 81 57 62 43 57 43 81 62 57 29","output":"12"},{"input":"20\n53 7 97 50 63 6 84 6 6 43 43 6 84 43 7 63 50 53 63 50","output":"1"},{"input":"30\n44 21 84 57 44 44 57 84 44 21 44 21 44 84 44 21 83 57 44 44 57 57 84 84 83 83 84 84 84 83","output":"145"},{"input":"30\n75 17 17 75 17 75 17 76 17 37 17 75 17 76 76 75 17 37 75 17 37 37 17 37 76 17 17 75 76 75","output":"169"},{"input":"1000\n19 82 6 24 49 28 86 9 75 95 91 65 98 55 31 50 67 24 5 4 16 34 57 69 70 48 89 71 85 93 54 53 29 77 79 14 96 77 35 88 25 26 61 11 69 96 97 9 58 79 72 70 47 89 69 47 45 81 95 50 48 73 3 58 24 95 14 14 6 56 73 100 87 12 82 63 23 91 9 66 39 44 50 76 32 85 64 90 2 7 57 49 7 18 16 25 93 23 80 93 22 31 6 41 100 60 51 48 27 14 57 77 31 75 28 8 75 60 20 58 29 84 92 74 31 12 42 42 4 45 33 55 97 62 75 28 76 45 34 100 78 53 82 97 66 86 55 30 72 2 4 47 20 78 58 39 69 52 87 97 27 87 42 7 60 79 74 71 38 13 96 73 15 20 22 88 69 78 97 36 19 81 10 12 99 56 7 75 76 80 29 50 92 15 86 76 12 21 25 7 72 88 96 5 7 63 25 65 63 18 13 85 100 96 27 89 64 34 83 68 25 61 33 19 35 40 94 57 68 37 28 47 38 59 3 80 76 38 91 54 36 19 44 31 48 65 61 58 70 97 34 70 54 67 100 95 83 32 89 95 26 21 41 14 13 43 63 71 90 10 26 54 5 16 54 45 73 35 9 4 31 36 14 14 63 24 71 98 88 65 44 2 52 70 29 87 84 93 84 9 69 64 43 2 62 77 55 48 64 25 78 16 6 46 64 8 17 51 60 66 43 27 6 52 17 81 91 78 11 65 73 98 51 53 67 52 74 74 17 21 20 99 91 74 60 33 59 43 1 44 79 82 49 30 55 38 33 3 79 27 79 60 6 36 77 5 100 37 88 94 40 55 26 9 39 70 40 52 67 98 51 63 90 28 38 46 85 88 36 84 81 98 65 46 97 43 18 86 53 37 56 22 41 33 62 80 24 85 29 83 59 35 81 16 28 36 50 47 47 24 100 29 28 27 50 24 83 92 15 62 46 19 51 42 13 39 46 22 95 43 7 17 69 24 75 10 37 44 60 84 68 72 73 60 56 93 22 15 39 39 71 72 61 98 1 50 4